1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 20]</font>

15
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Little lanterns!</font>

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a look!</font>

17
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did he not hear what I said?</font>

18
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or does he not want
this handkerchief anymore?</font>

19
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or does he not want to see me?</font>

20
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, impossible.</font>

21
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though I was a bit disheveled that day,</font>

22
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my bearing was still quite fine.</font>

23
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That man.</font>

24
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I cannot afford
to lose my bearing.</font>

25
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

26
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

27
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, is something the matter?</font>

28
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, nothing.</font>

29
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mistook you for someone else.</font>

30
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

31
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can I still have the chance to return
this handkerchief to you?</font>

32
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

33
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't we at Nightfall Haven?</font>

34
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we here?</font>

35
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

36
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you still remember</font>

37
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what you did to me</font>

38
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Nightfall Haven?</font>

39
00:02:58,760 --> 00:02:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

40
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you keep this up,
I truly cannot bear it.</font>

41
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wouldn't...</font>

42
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

43
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't...</font>

44
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Darn it.</font>

45
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't I remember anything?</font>

46
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for what I did.</font>

47
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take full responsibility.</font>

48
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is indeed Changle.</font>

49
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is secretly raising
a private force.</font>

50
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To eliminate this hidden threat,</font>

51
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we must clip her wings immediately,</font>

52
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lest jackals rule the way.</font>

53
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought Nightfall Haven's true power</font>

54
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was the Shadow Master.</font>

55
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would have guessed</font>

56
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Shadow Master is merely a shadow?</font>

57
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle plans
to reveal her true identity</font>

58
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the Moon Banquet.</font>

59
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She must be plotting
something significant.</font>

60
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as the root of evil remains,</font>

61
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the turmoil will not end.</font>

62
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if she is my elder sister,</font>

63
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can no longer spare her.</font>

64
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since we have secured entry
to the Moon Banquet,</font>

65
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should send someone</font>

66
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to infiltrate it directly,</font>

67
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">catch them off guard,</font>

68
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">strike her down on the spot,</font>

69
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and eliminate the root of the problem.</font>

70
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is the mastermind.</font>

71
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she is dead,</font>

72
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the rebel remnants
will lose their backbone.</font>

73
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then they will no longer be a threat.</font>

74
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But who should handle</font>

75
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this matter?</font>

76
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

77
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only you have been to Nightfall Haven.</font>

78
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear there is no one</font>

79
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more suitable for this task than you.</font>

80
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This dagger</font>

81
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was bestowed upon me
by the late emperor.</font>

82
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I entrust it</font>

83
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to you.</font>

84
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go capture the rebels,</font>

85
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and root out the traitors.</font>

86
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need not hold anything back.</font>

87
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go forth with all your might.</font>

88
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

89
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not fail this trust.</font>

90
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is one more matter.</font>

91
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you will grant it.</font>

92
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

93
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I humbly beg you</font>

94
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pardon Governor Qin of Guanzhou</font>

95
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and his family.</font>

96
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years ago,</font>

97
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were executed and thrown</font>

98
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the mass burial mound.</font>

99
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if we searched now,</font>

100
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we wouldn't even find
a handful of bones.</font>

101
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your choosing this moment
to clear their name</font>

102
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leaves me truly baffled.</font>

103
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

104
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're already dead.</font>

105
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why cling to a hollow reputation?</font>

106
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lately, every night in my dreams,</font>

107
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see my betrothed, Qin Wei.</font>

108
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Night after night, she questions me,</font>

109
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tormenting me without end,</font>

110
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and asking me why I abandoned her family</font>

111
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to live on alone.</font>

112
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Therefore,</font>

113
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must risk incurring your wrath</font>

114
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and beg you for mercy.</font>

115
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if it's just
a secret imperial edict,</font>

116
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I may finally give her</font>

117
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an answer in my dreams,</font>

118
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so that before I enter Nightfall Haven,</font>

119
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll grant me a few days of peace.</font>

120
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

121
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has devoted himself
to the nation.</font>

122
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were to refuse him,</font>

123
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would seem rather unreasonable.</font>

124
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would not dare</font>

125
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">overstep.</font>

126
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is all for you to decide.</font>

127
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Issue my decree.</font>

128
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Granted.</font>

129
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you,</font>

130
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

131
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

132
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you back so soon?</font>

133
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did His Majesty say?</font>

134
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He plans to surround the lake
during the banquet.</font>

135
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Taking advantage of the feast,</font>

136
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll seize everyone at Nightfall Haven</font>

137
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Changle.</font>

138
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

139
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means</font>

140
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can save my brother very soon.</font>

141
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

142
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my brother may still have
some misgivings about you.</font>

143
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't lose your temper then.</font>

144
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever happens,
let's discuss it calmly.</font>

145
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we talk it through, it'll be fine.</font>

146
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You feel so cold.</font>

147
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

148
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finally found you.</font>

149
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, you have no idea.</font>

150
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come here to wait
for you every day.</font>

151
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And today, at last, I caught you.</font>

152
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't let you leave again.</font>

153
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

154
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss,</font>

155
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not acquainted with you.</font>

156
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please let me pass.</font>

157
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

158
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you hurt your hand?</font>

159
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me bandage it for you.</font>

160
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me your hand.</font>

161
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In broad daylight,</font>

162
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please, show some restraint.</font>

163
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Broad daylight?</font>

164
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you said, it's in broad daylight.</font>

165
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What could I possibly do to you?</font>

166
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then do it yourself.</font>

167
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My handkerchief.</font>

168
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found it.</font>

169
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am truly impressive.</font>

170
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

171
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to bandage it for you.</font>

172
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This handkerchief is all dirty now.</font>

173
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should we do?</font>

174
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, your manner is quite unique.</font>

175
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How free-spirited.</font>

176
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is truly enviable.</font>

177
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can call me Ying.</font>

178
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which family are you from?</font>

179
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I address you?</font>

180
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang Ying.</font>

181
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't be seeing each other again.</font>

182
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does he mean?</font>

183
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]</font>

184
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

185
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time, I've truly met</font>

186
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my destined one.</font>

187
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

188
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been quietly making big moves.</font>

189
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this good news?</font>

190
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you sighing?</font>

191
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What good news?</font>

192
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sadly, the feelings are not mutual.</font>

193
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't pay me any attention.</font>

194
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then his judgment must be flawed.</font>

195
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so outstanding.</font>

196
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were a man,</font>

197
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would definitely marry you.</font>

198
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that right?</font>

199
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, tell me.</font>

200
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How outstanding am I, exactly?</font>

201
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got a good attitude.</font>

202
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that it?</font>

203
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing more?</font>

204
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder he's not interested in me.</font>

205
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What use is a good attitude?</font>

206
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then tell me.</font>

207
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How handsome</font>

208
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is he?</font>

209
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has</font>

210
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a face like polished jade</font>

211
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and eyes as bright as stars.</font>

212
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is</font>

213
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like someone from an opera script.</font>

214
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His words are gentle</font>

215
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet distant.</font>

216
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He seems almost too sacred to touch.</font>

217
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyway,</font>

218
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whenever I see him,</font>

219
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel so shy.</font>

220
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what I mean?</font>

221
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just like that.</font>

222
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beauty lies in the lover's eyes.</font>

223
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How true.</font>

224
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

225
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You summoned me, Your Highness.</font>

226
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask why?</font>

227
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did you go
after the market closed?</font>

228
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I passed by the Mi River.</font>

229
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw the begonias in full bloom,</font>

230
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I bought a pot to bring back</font>

231
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to brighten up my bedchamber.</font>

232
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the way, did you meet anyone</font>

233
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and exchange any words?</font>

234
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the way,</font>

235
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I encountered a young lady
asking for directions.</font>

236
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Knowing my position is delicate,</font>

237
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kept the exchange brief.</font>

238
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I despise most</font>

239
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is betrayal.</font>

240
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The root of betrayal</font>

241
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is suspicion.</font>

242
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you already find me untrustworthy,</font>

243
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please withdraw my post.</font>

244
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather stay at your mansion</font>

245
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than have you harbor</font>

246
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any resentment toward me.</font>

247
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you say that, Bai?</font>

248
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were to lose you,</font>

249
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd lose my right hand.</font>

250
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For you, the Moon Banquet is</font>

251
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of utmost importance.</font>

252
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Success or failure hinges on this.</font>

253
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly because of that,</font>

254
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should choose</font>

255
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone else.</font>

256
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all,</font>

257
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am no longer the one you trust most.</font>

258
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fuhai.</font>

259
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

260
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drag that gossiper out</font>

261
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and feed him to the dogs.</font>

262
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

263
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you satisfied now, Bai?</font>

264
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up.</font>

265
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your knees must be aching.</font>

266
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My heart aches even more.</font>

267
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, you.</font>

268
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You appear so refined and gentle,</font>

269
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you're truly unyielding at the core.</font>

270
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have misjudged you.</font>

271
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go attend to your matters first.</font>

272
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will come find you later.</font>

273
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your understanding.</font>

274
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

275
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep a close watch on him.</font>

276
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Your Highness.</font>

277
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you truly</font>

278
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">entrusting the Moon Banquet,</font>

279
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">such a monumental affair,</font>

280
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to him?</font>

281
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has to be him.</font>

282
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If something goes wrong,</font>

283
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll be my life-saving token.</font>

284
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean Xizhao...?</font>

285
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

286
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door.</font>

287
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it right now.</font>

288
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you.</font>

289
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so foolish.</font>

290
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me out now.</font>

291
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle it. You go rest.</font>

292
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

293
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

294
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

295
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You finally came.</font>

296
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

297
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop struggling in vain.</font>

298
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about it.</font>

299
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our standing</font>

300
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Father's eyes</font>

301
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:14,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is different.</font>

302
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, enough.</font>

303
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spare me your nonsense.</font>

304
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been</font>

305
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">locked up in here.</font>

306
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan</font>

307
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be so worried about me.</font>

308
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

309
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun is</font>

310
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doing quite well for herself.</font>

311
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not just apologize to Father?</font>

312
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you can focus</font>

313
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on your career</font>

314
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bring honor to our father.</font>

315
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could she possibly be fine?</font>

316
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm stuck here.</font>

317
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hasn't she even asked about me?</font>

318
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

319
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's now all lovey-dovey</font>

320
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Prince Duan.</font>

321
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's enjoying it.</font>

322
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suggest you</font>

323
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give it up.</font>

324
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't even think about it.</font>

325
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't believe you.</font>

326
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

327
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

328
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't try to fool me with those lies.</font>

329
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you.</font>

330
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must get out today.</font>

331
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch closely.</font>

332
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:01,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One,</font>

333
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">two,</font>

334
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">three.</font>

335
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

336
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

337
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, I...</font>

338
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really have urgent business.</font>

339
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a coincidence.</font>

340
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have urgent business too.</font>

341
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, what is the matter?</font>

342
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Blind dates.</font>

343
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

344
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forgive me.</font>

345
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]
I am skilled in the four arts.</font>

346
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask what hobbies you have?</font>

347
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drinking and gambling.</font>

348
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love them all.</font>

349
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am skilled in the culinary arts.</font>

350
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask what you like to eat?</font>

351
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pig intestines.</font>

352
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sliced raw fish.</font>

353
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you prepare that?</font>

354
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have an extraordinary bearing.</font>

355
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">May I ask what kind of lady you fancy?</font>

356
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't fancy</font>

357
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a woman like you.</font>

358
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan?</font>

359
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

360
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you also my matchmaking prospect?</font>

361
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to have a word with you.</font>

362
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With me?</font>

363
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're too lovey-dovey</font>

364
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Qinglan every day</font>

365
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have leisure to come chat with me.</font>

366
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still care for Jun Qinglan?</font>

367
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What good would it do if I did?</font>

368
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be serious.</font>

369
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am truly fond of Qinglan.</font>

370
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what?</font>

371
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if one day,</font>

372
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she commits a heinous crime</font>

373
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that might even implicate you?</font>

374
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The blade falls</font>

375
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on my neck first.</font>

376
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not let anyone</font>

377
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">harm Jun Qinglan.</font>

378
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

379
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

380
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">remember every word</font>

381
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've spoken today for me.</font>

382
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, wait.</font>

383
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly</font>

384
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you trying to say?</font>

385
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

386
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I leave her in your care.</font>

387
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

388
00:17:31,630 --> 00:17:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

389
00:17:33,300 --> 00:17:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

390
00:17:37,220 --> 00:17:41,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

391
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

392
00:17:45,890 --> 00:17:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

393
00:17:50,410 --> 00:17:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

394
00:17:54,740 --> 00:18:00,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

395
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

396
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

397
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:15,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

398
00:18:16,140 --> 00:18:19,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

399
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:24,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

400
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
